{"2922140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PSYCHExFUSE", "steam_appid": 2922140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/a2e9a1e97cd8334985842ff1ca120363.avif?t=1779123365\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Engage in turn-based battles for survival against incomprehensible creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Face the consequences of your actions with alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Experience beautiful hand-drawn cutscenes and a diverse, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/c0af31fdb247120834fc90998d574590.webp?t=1779123365\" width=830 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.poster.avif?t=1779123365\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.webm?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.mp4?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A sprawling world of nostalgia that seems a bit too dark, abandoned, and almost inhuman.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Do not be fooled by the comfort these wonders bring - for you may suffer the same terror as its residents.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/657a2f169d785dbad94f476fa0fadd76.webp?t=1779123365\" width=469 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.poster.avif?t=1779123365\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.webm?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.mp4?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It seems you are not alone.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It defies all logic... Who is the true self here? Perhaps it is true that not everyone should trust themselves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This begs the question, if there is another &quot;self&quot;... could there be many more?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/982993654463e96051484e496defcf01.webp?t=1779123365\" width=830 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.poster.avif?t=1779123365\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.webm?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.mp4?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;She promised you an escape in exchange for becoming her vessel?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;And you truly believe her memories are gone and powers extinguished? Well, if naught else, she is good for soft words and encouragement to navigate her ruined land.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9529697ba1f3aa8a8e2deed51e37dc26.webp?t=1779123365\" width=843 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/39bfaafcddb93c641a952dfa43bd5522.poster.avif?t=1779123365\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/39bfaafcddb93c641a952dfa43bd5522.webm?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/39bfaafcddb93c641a952dfa43bd5522.mp4?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;You'd best avoid combat where possible, dear lost lamb. Without Fusion, you will easily succumb to the terrors which stalk these facilities.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;With a strategic mind, however, you may just be able to outsmart them.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/87c1c9aed032bd11cc58865a32fc86fd.webp?t=1779123365\" width=830 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.poster.avif?t=1779123365\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.webm?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.mp4?t=1779123365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A new world means new opportunities. Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind your being.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph