o/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A new world means new opportunities. Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind your being.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/666bd7af102085ef1f39cc35095d92e3.avif?t=1779123365\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PSYCHExFUSE</i></strong> will be a 3-part saga, with <strong><i>Part 1: L.C.D</i></strong> launching as an Early Access Title in late 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "CONQUER YOUR SELF and escape the pastel-colored nightmare in PSYCHExFUSE, a brand new RPG horror filled with mystery, challenges and terror. Unite worlds - and your past selves - in an interdimensional adventure into the deepest depths of your mind...", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“It's well worth checking out - the story is intriguing and mature in its themes and execution.”<br>MerriestKiwi<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/c05c33e23a11dea117c9e19c5030e227ff912959/header.jpg?t=1779123365", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/dab9cff554fc9a037c9c97474a1a357e481b50dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779123365", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/dab9cff554fc9a037c9c97474a1a357e481b50dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177912